<title>UZBEKISTAN: Uzbek September unemployment is 0.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Uzbek September unemployment is 0.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TASHKENT 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people registered as unemployed in Uzbekistan in September totalled 40,020 or 0.5 percent of the workforce, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    UZBEK UNEMPLOYMENT	     Sep 96	 Sep 95</p>
<p>    number unemployed	     40,020	  32,884</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce	0.5	     N/A</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
